1
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,150
The Dragon's Dragon, is the last one.

2
00:00:14,233 --> 00:00:17,355
The Dragon's Dragon's Dragon's
Dragon, is the last one.

3
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:21,357
It's a long time for the Dragon's Dragon,

4
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,969
but it's a long time
for a Dragon's Dragon.

5
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,340
Over here, you moron!

6
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:52,060
Miss Nagi, this is the
maid who offed Ronko.

7
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,697
One of my maids caught her sliming around.

8
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:56,297
Which cafe is she from?

9
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:57,720
Wuv Wuv Moonbeam,

10
00:00:57,860 --> 00:01:00,877
the one that Ronco wiped out right
after getting out of the slammer.

11
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:03,297
Do you have any idea what you've done?

12
00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:04,210
You don't owe me!

13
00:01:04,293 --> 00:01:06,857
I'm not your creature, nor
am I an axolotl either!

14
00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:08,900
I'm a friggin' black space bunny!

15
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:11,957
Wuv Wuv Moonbeam is the
only home I'll ever know!

16
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:13,457
Were you seeking revenge?

17
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:16,069
Hey boss, should she
sleep with the fishes?

18
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:18,441
What do you say?

19
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:21,240
An enjoyable maid cafe, how funny.

20
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:23,292
You can release her now.

21
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,390
Uh, but boss...

22
00:01:24,473 --> 00:01:25,617
Don't make me say it twice.

23
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:26,740
Yes, ma 'am.

24
00:01:28,060 --> 00:01:30,531
Squeak all you want, it'll do you no good.

25
00:01:30,660 --> 00:01:31,777
You're a creature now.

26
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:34,020
Let's see you prove your worth. Huh?

27
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:36,025
What is that supposed to mean?

28
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:41,540
The time has come to go
full bore on those swine.

29
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:44,500
Prepare for an all-out war.

30
00:01:55,700 --> 00:01:56,660
damn maids.

31
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:59,557
I really wish they wouldn't
use the same funeral hall.

32
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:02,052
It's another gang war casualty, isn't it?

33
00:02:02,220 --> 00:02:05,760
I heard this maid got out of
prison less than a year ago.

34
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,597
I bet she deserved it.

35
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:10,797
I just wish Akiba could be
rid of all these maid cafes.

36
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:12,577
Where are the police when you need them?

37
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:13,490
Not so loud.

38
00:02:13,620 --> 00:02:16,385
You never know what
they'll do if they hear us.

39
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:19,266
Did you hear the news
that Ronco Manon's dead?

40
00:02:19,420 --> 00:02:21,757
That's what the porker
gets for getting cocky.

41
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:22,670
Ha!

42
00:02:22,753 --> 00:02:25,617
A 36-year-old maid dying feels
like the end of a bygone era.

43
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:26,757
You know what I mean?

44
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,428
Damn straight, bear friend.

45
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:32,377
The other swine will be quick to follow,
so she won't be alone for very long.

46
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:35,417
It just goes to show you that
Akiba needs more beef than pork.

47
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:36,537
You know what I mean?

48
00:02:36,620 --> 00:02:38,460
Okay, see ya. See you later.

49
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:48,540
Tell me where I can find
the maid who killed Ronko.

50
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,581
You're that pig from Oinky Doink.

51
00:02:52,340 --> 00:02:53,720
Who killed Ronko?

52
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:55,959
Who the hell should I fucking know?

53
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:59,880
Now we can tag your ear like
the useless heifer you are.

54
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:02,720
How about I give you a nose ring next?

55
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,877
All right, all right, just stop!

56
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,640
I'll talk, I'll talk, okay?

57
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:09,056
The worthless scum that killed Ronco.

58
00:03:09,220 --> 00:03:11,937
It's a maid that used to
work at Wov Wov Moonbeam.

59
00:03:12,020 --> 00:03:13,277
Did the head give the order?

60
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,877
I don't know anything about that,

61
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:18,917
but I do know the head's rounding up soldiers
and weapons to crush the oinky-doink.

62
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,840
And where is she right now?

63
00:03:21,140 --> 00:03:24,611
You think an underling maid
like me would know that answer?

64
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,480
Come on, let me go!

65
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:30,020
Now you go tell the other creatures.

66
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,500
Nagomi Wahira is in mourning.

67
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:35,020
Tell them I'm black pork now.

68
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:46,477
I want to know about the
maid named Uzuko who used

69
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:49,077
to work upstairs when it
was the maid tea room.

70
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,320
Never heard of her.

71
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,657
I don't have time for this.

72
00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:55,211
I need you to tell me where she lives now.

73
00:03:55,320 --> 00:03:57,137
Why the heck would I know that?

74
00:03:57,220 --> 00:03:58,697
Then where do her parents live?

75
00:03:58,780 --> 00:04:00,839
Like I said, I don't know anything.

76
00:04:02,740 --> 00:04:04,280
Is that Ronko's gun?

77
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:12,412
If you have some time, I'll
tell you a bit about the past.

78
00:04:12,980 --> 00:04:15,160
It was 20-something years ago.

79
00:04:15,460 --> 00:04:19,637
A maid named Michio brought an
orphan named Uzuko home with her.

80
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:24,300
Even as a kid, her eyes always
looked starved for something.

81
00:04:25,780 --> 00:04:28,697
That was back when Michio
had a steel grip and

82
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:31,500
was well known as a
warmonger maid in Akiba.

83
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:35,500
She intended to raise
Uzuko as her successor.

84
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:40,540
But it wasn't until Ronko joined
the cafe that Michio changed.

85
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:44,440
I think Ronko's innocent
sincerity rubbed off on her.

86
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:47,457
Michio changed her policy to make the Maid

87
00:04:47,540 --> 00:04:50,440
Tea House a cafe that
didn't rely on violence.

88
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:52,900
A far cry from what it was.

89
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:54,800
But Uzuko,

90
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:59,631
as starved as she was, couldn't bear
to see Michio give up all the violence.

91
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:12,350
Jisoo!

92
00:05:15,740 --> 00:05:19,600
And so Usoko arranged a hit
on Michio and killed her.

93
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:23,220
And now, sadly, Ronko's dead as well.

94
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:26,220
Usoko has no place she can call home now,

95
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:28,997
so I reckon she doesn't
even have an address.

96
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,668
Not that I would know that.

97
00:05:30,860 --> 00:05:34,900
She craves immense power because
she's afraid of being all alone.

98
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:38,180
But that power is why she is all alone.

99
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,780
She's a sad, foolish creature.

100
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:45,678
If you don't intend to eat anything,
I'm going to need you to get out.

101
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,654
Sorry for the trouble.

102
00:05:47,780 --> 00:05:49,486
Hey, you're not going to eat?

103
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:00,777
Nagomi, where have you been all this time?

104
00:06:00,860 --> 00:06:02,557
You're still wearing that thing?

105
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:04,737
You didn't even come to the funeral.

106
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:06,840
Hey! What? Nagomi?

107
00:06:08,140 --> 00:06:09,081
Where's the key?

108
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,358
It's a chip, is it?

109
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,497
Excuse me, what do you think you're doing?

110
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:21,117
The creatures are coming for us.

111
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:22,030
For real?

112
00:06:22,113 --> 00:06:23,617
We're going to need a lot of guns.

113
00:06:23,700 --> 00:06:26,077
So you're just going to steal
the cafe's money to buy weapons?

114
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,897
We don't have any time to spare.

115
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:31,098
If we don't get prepared
quick, they'll slaughter us.

116
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:32,574
You need to calm down.

117
00:06:33,940 --> 00:06:35,705
How can you be calm right now?

118
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,517
You're all still maids, aren't you?

119
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,997
They just took out one of our own.

120
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:41,377
If they kill one of ours,
we take out one of theirs.

121
00:06:41,460 --> 00:06:42,657
Isn't that what maids do?

122
00:06:42,740 --> 00:06:43,681
Zoya, get ready.

123
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:47,417
Look, I'm gonna send as many
goddamn creatures to hell as I can.

124
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:50,735
Then I'm gonna see Ronko
there with a smile on my face.

125
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:18,085
Nerula, please forgive
me for having to change.

126
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,911
Sorry I disappointed you.

127
00:07:31,540 --> 00:07:33,120
Well, well, well.

128
00:07:33,340 --> 00:07:36,460
You sure got me the
utter day, ugly pig face.

129
00:07:36,900 --> 00:07:38,197
You think you pigs can get off?

130
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:39,868
What's going on over there?

131
00:07:42,900 --> 00:07:45,120
Here, have an otter one!

132
00:07:45,420 --> 00:07:46,700
And an otter!

133
00:07:51,220 --> 00:07:53,660
So, are you satisfied?

134
00:07:54,780 --> 00:07:58,120
Is that enough to satisfy you?

135
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,760
Time to die, pig.

136
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,557
Is this about...

137
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:07,497
Is this all what being a
maid's about? What's that?

138
00:08:07,580 --> 00:08:11,557
All this threatening and beating and
killing, is that really all the fun for you?

139
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:14,597
Do you find enjoyment in
making people scared of you?

140
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:16,504
What the hell's wrong with her?

141
00:08:16,740 --> 00:08:18,975
What's the point of being a maid, huh?

142
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,180
Come tell me!

143
00:08:20,420 --> 00:08:23,417
I think she must have snapped
from getting clobbered too much.

144
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:24,920
I'll enter right here.

145
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:29,377
Hey, there's too many
people around right now.

146
00:08:29,460 --> 00:08:30,342
You better not.

147
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:32,250
Fine.

148
00:08:34,620 --> 00:08:37,326
She's only got a few
days left to live anyway.

149
00:08:37,580 --> 00:08:39,420
Hey, aren't you mates?

150
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:41,520
Hey, let's have some more fun!

151
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:43,231
We can be mates together!

152
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:11,040
She should have just thrown
this shabby thing away.

153
00:09:13,580 --> 00:09:16,100
Who keeps this kind of silly thing anyway?

154
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:17,920
Is this dirt?

155
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:20,320
Jeez, why would you want that?

156
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:29,520
Just look at how awful I look.

157
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:44,807
Damn it, she wants us
to raid the pigsty now?

158
00:09:45,020 --> 00:09:46,517
We don't have the time to prepare.

159
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:48,937
Are you seriously questioning
the head's decision?

160
00:09:49,020 --> 00:09:50,177
That's not what I mean.

161
00:09:50,260 --> 00:09:53,337
But still, I have no idea what
the head is thinking nowadays.

162
00:09:53,420 --> 00:09:56,457
It's ever since that Ronco
maid got out of the joint.

163
00:09:56,540 --> 00:09:57,952
She disowned the pigsty,

164
00:09:58,160 --> 00:10:01,837
then took them back, and now she's trying
to crush those damn hogs once again.

165
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:04,280
It's not easy to cope with. True that.

166
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:07,913
Maybe it's time for Miss
Noggy's reign to come to an end.

167
00:10:13,220 --> 00:10:14,050
Nagomi!

168
00:10:14,133 --> 00:10:15,057
Where the hell did you run off to?

169
00:10:15,140 --> 00:10:15,970
What the hell?

170
00:10:16,053 --> 00:10:17,428
What happened to your face?

171
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:20,957
Nagomi, we're ready to stand up and fight.

172
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,420
Time to avenge Ranko.

173
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:24,477
We'll take down as many of them as we can.

174
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:28,384
If it's a war they want, let's
grit our teeth and just go for it.

175
00:10:29,260 --> 00:10:30,090
Nagomi?

176
00:10:30,580 --> 00:10:33,740
At first, I wasn't so sure
about Ranko as a maid.

177
00:10:34,300 --> 00:10:36,837
She didn't have a heart,
she looked dead serious,

178
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:39,214
and she killed people on her first day.

179
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:43,840
But now, I understand that being
a maid with Ronko was so much fun.

180
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:47,020
She said that Oinky Doink was her family.

181
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:49,597
I don't want to lose this place either.

182
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:51,120
This is my home too.

183
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:53,717
But the creatures are
coming for us, aren't they?

184
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:55,565
It'll be a fight to the death.

185
00:10:55,880 --> 00:10:57,704
We're creatures too, after all.

186
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:01,840
Do you enjoy the way Oinky
Doink is now, Shipon?

187
00:11:04,180 --> 00:11:07,356
Are your masters feeling the
love when they come home?

188
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,306
Is your mouth turned upwards?

189
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:11,940
My mouth is very sad.

190
00:11:12,340 --> 00:11:14,537
But there's nothing we
can do about it now.

191
00:11:14,620 --> 00:11:16,637
I think we can do anything we want.

192
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,100
Because we are maids.

193
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,722
You have something in mind then?

194
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:24,012
We'll spring a maid war on those bitches.

195
00:11:33,340 --> 00:11:37,077
Moose Nagi, would you consider
exterminating the pigs at a later date?

196
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:38,737
We haven't paid off the cops yet.

197
00:11:38,820 --> 00:11:43,217
If we cause much more bloodshed, a fair
number of maids will end up in the slammer.

198
00:11:43,300 --> 00:11:44,580
We stick to the plan.

199
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:47,137
You mentioned that you want
to take part in the slaughter.

200
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:49,160
Are you serious? I am.

201
00:11:50,500 --> 00:11:52,357
Whittle Teddy here thinks you shouldn't.

202
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:57,260
If anything were to
happen, I couldn't bear it.

203
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:12,740
Any maids who refuse to obey me will die.

204
00:12:16,160 --> 00:12:19,197
Large ramen, extra veggies, topped
with sauce and a load of garlic.

205
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:20,297
Six of them, please, sir.

206
00:12:20,380 --> 00:12:21,851
Make that seven, old man.

207
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,310
Sure.

208
00:12:40,420 --> 00:12:42,917
Nogomi, let me have some
of that ramen, please.

209
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,377
I want some of that ramen, too.

210
00:12:44,460 --> 00:12:45,401
Looks delicious.

211
00:12:46,140 --> 00:12:47,920
Can I have a slurp, please?

212
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:06,144
It's been a while since
you've been here, Uzuko.

213
00:13:07,860 --> 00:13:08,900
Ronko's dead.

214
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:10,390
She...

215
00:13:10,473 --> 00:13:11,997
I'm about to slaughter the hogs.

216
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:14,160
Better get lost. Did you know?

217
00:13:14,340 --> 00:13:16,360
Ronko still called you her sister.

218
00:13:17,700 --> 00:13:18,530
Enough.

219
00:13:19,220 --> 00:13:22,920
I just wish you and Ronko could
have had my ramen one life.

220
00:13:24,580 --> 00:13:27,037
Dipping noodles are the
new thing now, old man.

221
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,400
Damn dipping noodles.

222
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,550
Let's go.

223
00:14:04,180 --> 00:14:05,780
Welcome home to the pigsty!

224
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:07,150
Pigsty?

225
00:14:07,233 --> 00:14:09,937
Wow, I can't believe we have
so many mistresses here.

226
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:11,577
What a sweet, sweet surprise!

227
00:14:11,660 --> 00:14:14,817
Are you, like, super nervous
because we're crazy cute?

228
00:14:14,900 --> 00:14:16,197
Come on, mistresses, relax!

229
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:19,357
There are lots of cute maids
here at Oinky Doink Cafe.

230
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:20,400
Cute maids?

231
00:14:20,500 --> 00:14:22,137
We've come to slaughter you.

232
00:14:22,220 --> 00:14:23,637
That's great, Oinky Doink.

233
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:27,197
But first, why not experience some
of our love here at Oinky Doink Cafe?

234
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:28,110
You shitting me?

235
00:14:28,193 --> 00:14:29,177
Welcome, mistresses.

236
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:32,077
Today happens to be our big
bang lovey-dovey heart event.

237
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:36,017
Any cute mistress with a gun will get
to enjoy all of our services for free.

238
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:37,159
Shall I kill them?

239
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,420
There's 26 of us.

240
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:40,780
Porky very much.

241
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:43,540
You heard her. Take a seat.

242
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,517
This here is our charming
brick house where us

243
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:51,037
cute little pigs live
called the Oinky Doink Cafe.

244
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:54,717
We are here to become the finest
Iberico pork to feed our humans.

245
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:57,877
Us piglets have been waiting
to serve all of you mistresses.

246
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:58,790
Oink!

247
00:14:58,873 --> 00:15:00,560
I'm hungry, jackass! Jackass?

248
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:02,917
There are no rabbits
or donkeys here, silly.

249
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,706
It's just a house of piglets.

250
00:15:04,940 --> 00:15:08,881
Miss Nagi, I heard you were once
a maid here in this very location.

251
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:10,620
